part b13_rows
  tally 2
  note "B-13's market rows: the real figures of the days B-13 rule 1 sells on (the 1st of each month from July 2025, the next business day where the 1st isn't one), which the judged text didn't need: the CBL's mid rate FX-FLR (gazette.csv, GEN-4, B-HR4 .5) and Bank Lazur's buy rate (lazur-fx-flr.csv, B-D23 §4). Each is published on its day, so each row is known on its day. The scenario b13_fx scales them with the rest."

version b13_fx_2025_07_01
  cite gazette
  governs 2025-07-01
  known 2025-07-01
  fx_mid = 4.2577 "gazette.csv line 1269 FX-FLR"

